  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Crazy Fingers** (1 other source): Crazy Fingers flows into Playin' In The Band, then He's Gone, then a jam leading into Drums [1]\n- **Playing In The Band** (1 review): Reviewer says the Playing in the Band into He's Gone pairing fit together nicely in the second set [3]\n- **The Other One** (1 other source): The Other One follows a jam after Drums, then moves into Wharf Rat and Around & Around [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1991-06-09.134008.akg414btl-fob-dantepper.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 163 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Violent Femmes opened this date, but the show was at Buckeye Lake, Ohio, not Buffalo, NY [2]\n- Reviewer recalls a sweaty early-June first set, and a neighbor sharing a large amount of pot in the second set [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1991-06-09.134008.akg414btl-fob-dantepper.flac16**: taped by Dan Tepper; transferred by Dan Tepper; source: Source: AKG 414-BTL (cardioid X-Y) > Neuman BS945i > Technics SVMD1 DAT; [1]",
